<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-LUCIC BEATS MORARIU IN CROATIAN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LUCIC BEATS MORARIU IN CROATIAN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BOL, Croatia 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the</p>
<p>$107,500 Croatian Open women's tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat Corina Morariu (U.S.) 7-5 6-7 7-6</p>
</text>
